Failure to comply will result in punishments. Knowingly bypassing the rules will result in a permanent ban from the Discord server.

- Do not create a post that isn't about reporting a bug;
- Imagine you are explaining the bug to a person, who has never played the game before when describing the bug;
- Follow the server rules at **all times**. Breaking any server-based rule will result in your access being revoked.
